General weapon advice for healers..., well...

Expert in unicorn horn and staff, both two-handed, but the latter
is interesting to enhance your proficiency for your quest artifact.
Skilled daggers as projectiles (even if darts can become expert),
because daggers won't vanish, and you just need a dozen or so.
Crysknife at expert as melee weapon is also very nice. Otherwise
any non-mean artifact that your god decides to give you and where
he grants you a basic weapon proficiency.

